OL,3,GNEWSAPatients felt 'hopeless' on
OL,4,Ainadequate mental health ward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rehabilitation unit for people with
OL,7,Fmental health conditions has been
OL,8,Fplaced in special measures after
OL,9,Fpatients said they felt a "sense of
OL,10,Fhopelessness" about their chances of
OL,11,Fleaving.
OL,13,FPine House Rehabilitation Unit in
OL,14,FBacup, Lancashire, has been downgraded
OL,15,Fto an inadequate rating by health
OL,16,Fwatchdog the Care Quality Commission
OL,17,F(CQC).
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1789129674
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPatients felt 'hopeless' on
OL,4,Ainadequate mental health ward
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients told the inspection team that
OL,7,Fthey felt "isolated and lonely" and
OL,8,Fwere only able to see their
OL,9,Fpsychiatrists for 10 minutes a month -
OL,10,Fsometimes over video calls.
OL,12,FKrinvest Care Group, which owns the
OL,13,Funit's registered operator Kibo
OL,14,FHospital Service Ltd, said it had taken
OL,15,Fthe CQC's concerns "seriously" and had
OL,16,Falready implemented improvements.
